Subject: [PATCH] Carpet local redstone update and interaction rules

From Lophine 7a51f49a, Minecraft 0131, 0132, 0133, 0134. See META-INF/licenses/carpet-26.3.txt.
Apply interaction sounds after success, keep redstone event cancellation, and bound suppression to the existing regional collecting backend. Preserve support across the Alternate Current wire discovery as well as native shape updates. Never inject a crashing exception or switch redstone engines.

